flowchart LR
    Queued[queued: reservation and SHA] --> Lease[Lease + auth]
    Lease --> Preparing[preparing: sources]
    Preparing --> Rendering[rendering: Typst]
    Rendering --> Publishing[publishing: attempt PDF]
    Publishing --> Fence{Current lease?}
    Fence -->|Yes| Success([succeeded])
    Fence -->|No| Orphan[Delete stale PDF]
    Preparing -. Transient failure .-> Retry{Retry budget?}
    Rendering -. Transient failure .-> Retry
    Publishing -. Transient failure .-> Retry
    Retry -->|Yes: delay| Queued
    Retry -->|No| Failed([failed])
    Rendering -->|Typst error or limit| Failed
    Preparing -->|Invalid source or limit| Failed
    Queued -->|Overall deadline exceeded| Expired([expired])
    Queued -->|Cancel + refund| Cancelled([canceled])
    Rendering -->|Cancel| Cancelling[cancelling: stop and clean up]
    Preparing -->|Cancel| Cancelling
    Publishing -->|Cancellation won the transaction| Cancelling
    Cancelling --> Cancelled
